          <a href="https://wa.me/919816091875" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.06em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(244,242,236,0.3); padding-bottom:4px;">OR WHATSAPP ↗</a>
